# Files excluded from rsconnect / shinyapps.io deployment.
# The tests/ directory is a local dev harness — it references an
# absolute path to the reference bundle on the developer's machine
# (see tests/test_comparison_long.R BUNDLE constant) and is not run
# on the deployed app. Skipping it here silences the rsconnect
# "path outside the project directory" warning at publish time.
tests/
